gargoyle --More-- The gargoyle is killed! --More-- The Titan casts a
spell!  The Titan looks better."  Sadly a hill giant with a wand of
death did in my pet Titan, and I had to slay the hill giant all by
myself.  Oddly, though, my "Creatures vanquished" list included a Titan
